Subject: [PATCH] B-17/B-18/B-19/B-20: masterTick every 10 min without
 HelloClient jobs; hide dead screens

LOCAL ONLY - not pushed, not deployed. masterTick no longer runs pollHelloClient,
watchdog, libraryShadowReport, sendNPS, processBroadcasts; cron */10. Hidden:
Importar HelloClient, Escanear HelloClient, Pedidos/Ventas/Inventario/Tareas.
Voice queue behind voice_enabled; weekly content-signals workflow removed.

